  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Dual Frontend Architecture",
      "items": [
        "React 19 + Vite dashboard (frontend/) uses TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, Recharts, and react-router-dom v7; communicates with FastAPI backend via REST API at localhost:8000",
        "Streamlit dashboard (dashboard/app.py) reads results/*.json directly via glob; launched by run_dashboard.py — independent of FastAPI with no API calls",
        "Both frontends are independent: React uses HTTP API, Streamlit uses direct filesystem reads from results/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Experiment Pipeline",
      "items": [
        "ExperimentRunner (experiments/runner.py) loops over PressureLevel × Personality × TaskDifficulty — 600 executions in the factorial campaign (run_campaign.py)",
        "SoftwareCompanySimulator (simulation/simulator.py) coordinates one sprint: ManagerAgent assigns tasks; each of four developer agents estimates and reports progress; AuditorAgent scores deception",
        "PolicyGenerator maps each PressureLevel (LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH/EXTREME) to a reward/penalty/deadline policy injected into each agent decision context"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Model Runtime",
      "items": [
        "OllamaClient (llm/ollama_client.py) wraps langchain_ollama.ChatOllama; model=qwen2.5:7b and temperature=0.3 are set in config/settings.py",
        "All six agent types inherit BaseAgent.think(), which builds [SystemMessage, HumanMessage] and calls self.llm.invoke(); provenance records raw prompts and responses",
        "Ollama daemon runs locally at localhost:11434; no cloud API is used; the qwen2.5:7b model is served on-device"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Storage & Artifacts",
      "items": [
        "utils/experiment_storage.py writes one experiment_<timestamp>_<uuid8>.json per agent observation into results/ or results/factorial_campaign/",
        "run_analysis.py reads result JSON files and writes CSV summaries (experiment_summary.csv) and PNG figures to results/plots/ and results/statistical_analysis/",
        "config/settings.py is source configuration; results/ sub-directories are generated experiment outputs written at runtime"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
